# Canonical identities for `git log`, `git shortlog` and GitHub's contributor
# list. A .mailmap changes how names are *displayed*; it rewrites no history and
# invalidates no commit id.
#
# The repository has one human author writing under several git configurations
# across machines and GitHub accounts. Collapsing them here keeps `git shortlog
# -sne` honest about who wrote this repository — and, in particular, stops
# decisions recorded in docs/decisions from appearing to come from an unrelated
# GitHub account that happens to hold the `dangt` handle.
